    "body_text": "Skip to content Buy Rent House Prices Find Agent Commercial Inspire Overseas Sign in Sign in Buy Property for sale New homes for sale Property valuation Investors Mortgages Rent Property to rent Student property to rent Find Agent Find estate agents House prices Sold house prices Instant online valuation Commercial Commercial property to rent Commercial property for sale Advertise Inspire Moving stories Property news Energy efficiency Property guides Housing trends Overseas blog Mortgage guides Overseas All countries Spain France Portugal Italy Greece Currency Sell Overseas property See similar properties Property photo 1 of 15. 1/15 Euston Road, London, NW1 £3,250 pcm £750 pw Tenancy info Reduced on 11/05/2026 Letting details Let available date: 10/06/2026 Deposit: £3,750 Furnish type: Furnished Council Tax: Ask agent PROPERTY TYPE Apartment BEDROOMS 1 BATHROOMS 1 SIZE 647 sq ft 60 sq m 1 +9 Key features Grade 1 Listed BuildingOne bedroom apartmentConciergeLiftHigh ceilingsExcellent specification unitClose to Kings Cross Station Description Situated on the third floor of this stunning Grade 1 listed landmark development, a beautifully presented and spacious one double bedroom apartment measuring approximately 647 square feet. This wonderful apartment features very high ceilings throughout, wooden flooring in the living area, modern fully fitted kitchen and a large open-plan living room. The flat is finished to a fantastic standard. The St Pancras Chambers apartments benefits from a 24-hour concierge and discounted rates for the facilities of The Renaissance Hotel. Possibly the best served location in London, having the choice of six different tube lines and an international station all on your door step, not to mention the varied shops, bars and restaurants of St Pancras this could make a wonderful central pied-à-terre. There is no parking included at this property – Interested applicants are advised to check with the local authority for information about any available permit parking. All known suppliers for mobile phone and broadband services are available in this area. Information regarding broadband options and phone signal can be obtained from the Ofcom broadband and mobile coverage checker. Please contact us for further details. It is not permitted for a tenant to register a company to the property or operate a business trade or profession from the property. Brochures Particulars Read full description COUNCIL TAX Band: F PARKING Ask agent GARDEN Ask agent ACCESSIBILITY Ask agent Energy Performance Certificate Utilities, rights & restrictions Euston Road, London, NW1 Approximate location Open map Street View My places Stations Schools Add an important place to see how long it'd take to get there from our property listings. __mins driving to your place Broadband speed About Stirling Ackroyd Lettings, West End Office 204, 60 St Martins Lane, WC2N 4JS The Hallmark of Quality and Experience Our story began in 1873 and since then, Stirling Ackroyd has stood the test of time through every high and low of the property market. We are proud of our heritage and the experience it allows us to bring to every client relationship. We understand that selling or letting a property is a significant decision, often involving important life changes and complex choices. That is why our teams combine local market expertise with a personal, professional approach, helping buyers, sellers, landlords and tenants navigate the process with confidence. Located in the centre of the capital, our West End office supports clients across some of London’s most prestigious residential neighbourhoods and high-value property markets. Read more View our properties to rent Find out more about us Notes These notes are private, only you can see them. Save note MARKETED BY Stirling Ackroyd Lettings, West End Office 204, 60 St Martins Lane, WC2N 4JS More properties from this agent Call agent Request details Staying secure when looking for propert